5d378ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"157\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/1674365288industrial-chemicals-300x157.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-2096\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/1674365288industrial-chemicals-300x157.png 300w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/1674365288industrial-chemicals-1024x536.png 1024w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/1674365288industrial-chemicals-768x402.png 768w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/1674365288industrial-chemicals.png 1200w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d4fa440 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d4fa440\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecf0f16 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ecf0f16\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c441d35 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c441d35\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>HD Marine gemi kimyasalları kategorisi, <strong>denizcilik sektöründe gemi bakım, temizlik, koruma ve operasyonel performansı artırmaya yönelik özel formüle edilmiş kimyasal ürünleri</strong> içerir. Bu ürünler; gemi yüzey bakımından, yakıt ve yağ sistemlerine, gemi temizliğinden çevre koruma uygulamalarına kadar geniş bir kullanım yelpazesine sahiptir.</p><p>Denizdeki zorlu çalışma koşullarında yüksek performans sunan gemi kimyasalları, hem ticari gemiler hem de yat/tekne sahipleri için güvenilir çözümler sağlar.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da7ce1d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"da7ce1d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-733c28a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"733c28a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7efea62 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7efea62\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-164873e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"164873e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Gemi Kimyasalları Kategorisine Genel Bakış</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c9c6bd5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c9c6bd5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>HD Marine gemi kimyasalları, aşağıdaki amaçlarla kullanılır:</p><ul><li>🛥️ <strong>Gemi yüzey temizliği ve cilalama</strong></li><li>🛠️ <strong>Motor, yakıt ve yağ sistem bakımı</strong></li><li>🛡️ <strong>Korozyon önleyici ve pas çözücü uygulamalar</strong></li><li>♻️ <strong>Atık su arıtma ve çevre koruma destek ürünleri</strong></li><li>⛽ <strong>Yakıt katkı maddeleri ve performans artırıcılar</strong></li></ul><p>Bu ürünler, deniz ortamının özelliklerine uygun olarak formüle edilmiş olup <strong>yüksek etki ve düşük çevresel etki</strong> sunar.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c45c720 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"c45c720\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-84acf7e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"84acf7e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Kategori Ürün Avantajları</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f4398ba elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f4398ba\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>✔ Denizcilik koşullarına göre optimize edilmiş<br />✔ Yüksek etkili formülasyon<br />✔ Aşındırıcı olmayan güvenli kullanım<br />✔ Çevre dostu alternatifler mevcut<br />✔ Endüstriyel ve marin standartlara uygun</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-22781d9 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"22781d9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-111247c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"111247c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Hangi Gemi Kimyasalları Bulunur?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f8e8ba3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f8e8ba3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li><strong>Gemi yüzey temizleyicileri</strong> – Tuzlu su, yağ ve kir çözücü</li><li><strong>Motor ve makine bakımı kimyasalları</strong> – Koruyucu yağlar, pas gidericiler</li><li><strong>Yakıt katkıları</strong> – Performans ve yakıt verimliliği artırıcılar</li><li><strong>Antifriz ve su gidericiler</strong> – Donma, rutubet ve korozyon önleme</li><li><strong>Atık su ve çevre ürünleri</strong> – Çevre normlarına uygun arıtım kimyasalları</li></ul><p>Her ürün kategorisi gemi bakım süreçlerini optimize etmek ve işletme verimliliğini artırmak amacıyla profesyonel sonuçlar sunar.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-17c1d54 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"17c1d54\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d4a4d51 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-accordion\" data-id=\"d4a4d51\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-accordion.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" >\n        <div class=\"elementskit-accordion accoedion-primary\" id=\"accordion-6a24aeb6bd5c6\">\n\n            \n                <div class=\"elementskit-card \">\n                    <div class=\"elementskit-card-header\" id=\"primaryHeading-0-d4a4d51\">\n                        <a href=\"#collapse-d9bc4456a24aeb6bd5c6\" class=\"ekit-accordion--toggler elementskit-btn-link collapsed\" data-ekit-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#Collapse-d9bc4456a24aeb6bd5c6\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"Collapse-d9bc4456a24aeb6bd5c6\">\n              